---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Prepare - China Starter Guide" lang="en">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12">
    <header class="mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 leading-tight mb-4">
        Prepare Before You Arrive
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-500">
        Essential steps to complete before landing in China — visa, documents, apps, and first-72-hours planning.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-6 not-prose">
      <!-- Visa Guide -->
      <a href="/en/prepare/visa/" class="block p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 hover:border-brand-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all group">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center">1</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 m-0 group-hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors">Visa & Entry Rules</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-600 ml-11">
          Check if you qualify for visa-free entry, 240-hour transit, or need a tourist (L) visa.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium ml-11 mt-2">Read guide →</p>
      </a>

      <!-- Entry Documents -->
      <div class="block p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 opacity-60">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-gray-200 text-gray-400 text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center">2</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 m-0">Entry Documents Checklist</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-600 ml-11">
          Passport, visa, arrival card, hotel bookings, and return ticket — what you actually need to show.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 ml-11 mt-2">Coming soon</p>
      </div>

      <!-- First 72 Hours -->
      <div class="block p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 opacity-60">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-gray-200 text-gray-400 text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center">3</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 m-0">First 72 Hours Plan</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-600 ml-11">
          What to do immediately after landing: SIM card, WeChat Pay, subway card, and internet access.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 ml-11 mt-2">Coming soon</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Safety -->
      <div class="block p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 opacity-60">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-gray-200 text-gray-400 text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center">4</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 m-0">Safety & Emergency Prep</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-600 ml-11">
          Police, ambulance, and embassy numbers to save before you fly. China is safe, but preparation helps.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 ml-11 mt-2">Coming soon</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
